# tail23 beam2: each beam (given) at the second Cyclops u0455, then damage/kill.
@f560 give darkBeam 1 ; give lightBeam 1 ; give annihilatorBeam 1
@f600 tp 148 211 -11
@f640 obj u0455
@f680 beam power ; shoot u0455 2
@f740 beam dark ; shoot u0455 2
@f800 beam light ; shoot u0455 charged 2
@f860 beam annihilator ; shoot u0455 charged 2
@f920 beam power ; shoot u0455 charged 3
@f980 damage u0455 20 power
@f1020 damage u0455 20 missile
@f1060 damage u0455 2000 powerbomb
@f1100 obj u0455
@f1140 status
@f1180 kill u0455
@f1220 obj u0455
